      "interaction": [
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.01.t01",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "xu_tang",
          "text": "[PLAYER_NAME]？",
          "source_line": 9
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.01.t02",
          "kind": "action",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "text": "我轉過身，看到許棠一手拿黑咖啡，另一手拿著餐盒。",
          "source_line": 11
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.01.t03",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "protagonist",
          "text": "欸，許棠，晚上好。這麼晚，妳也出來買吃的喔？",
          "source_line": 13
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.01.t04",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "xu_tang",
          "text": "嗯。你還沒吃？",
          "source_line": 15
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.01.t05",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "protagonist",
          "text": "還沒。冰箱開了又關，不知道要吃什麼，想想還是下樓好了。",
          "source_line": 17
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.01.t06",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "xu_tang",
          "text": "嗯……我懂。",
          "source_line": 19
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.01.t07",
          "kind": "action",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "text": "她看看我的餐盒，又看看自己那盒。我也低頭看了一眼。我們停了半秒，冷藏櫃的壓縮機又響起來。",
          "source_line": 21
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.01.t08",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "xu_tang",
          "text": "你拿的也是要微波的嗎？",
          "source_line": 23
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.01.t09",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "protagonist",
          "text": "對。其實就看哪個熱得快，挑了老半天。",
          "source_line": 25
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.01.t10",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "xu_tang",
          "text": "嗯。我也差不多。",
          "source_line": 27
        }
      ],
