      "interaction": [
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.02.t01",
          "kind": "action",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "text": "我看了一眼微波爐的計時器。",
          "source_line": 38
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.02.t02",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "protagonist",
          "text": "妳那個，工作上的東西，很趕嗎？",
          "source_line": 40
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.02.t03",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "xu_tang",
          "text": "明早客戶要看最後一輪。過了就送印，所以今天得改完。",
          "source_line": 42
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.02.t04",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "protagonist",
          "text": "送印……妳是做印刷的嗎？",
          "source_line": 44
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.02.t05",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "xu_tang",
          "text": "不是，我做視覺設計的，自己接案，這次剛好是要印出來的東西。",
          "source_line": 46
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.02.t06",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "protagonist",
          "text": "喔，不好意思我搞錯了。聽到送印就想到印刷。",
          "source_line": 48
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.02.t07",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "xu_tang",
          "text": "嗯，沒關係，很正常，常有人這樣說。",
          "source_line": 50
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.02.t08",
          "kind": "action",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "text": "微波爐提示音響了。我看見許棠抬起頭，店員從另一台取出她的餐盒。",
          "source_line": 52
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "voice.xu_tang.early.com02x.human.02.t09",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_id": "xu_tang",
          "text": "我的好了。",
          "source_line": 54
        }
      ],
